### 1. Trigger the Solver
# This calls the method that runs solverManager.solveAndListen()
POST http://localhost:8080/api/dispatcher/solve
Content-Type: application/json

###

### 2. Get All Pick Tasks
# Use this to check if "forklift_id" is still NULL or has been assigned
GET http://localhost:8080/api/dispatcher/solution
Accept: application/json